        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of January 3, 2026, we had approximately 1,615 staff globally, 419 in research and development, 263 in operations, 194 in administration and 739 in sales, applications and service support.",
        "start_character": 38425,
        "end_character": 38616
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the rapid and ongoing development of new products and enhancements to existing products are critical to our success.",
        "start_character": 36109,
        "end_character": 36241
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the use of these new materials and manufacturing methods has increased demand for our products such as the Atlas® product line, which is capable of measuring advanced nodes as certain features shrink beyond 7nm, to 5nm, 3nm and in the most advanced of cases, 2 nm or less.",
        "start_character": 6782,
        "end_character": 7065
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to invest in research and development to provide our customers with products that add value to their manufacturing processes and that provide a better and differentiated solution than our competitors so that our products stay in the forefront of current and future market demands.",
        "start_character": 35246,
        "end_character": 35538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide local direct sales, service and application support through our worldwide offices located in the United States, South Korea, Japan, Taiwan, Malaysia, China, Vietnam, Singapore and Europe, and work with selected dealers and sales representatives on a more limited basis in various countries.",
        "start_character": 29960,
        "end_character": 30261
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide system support to our customers through factory technical support and globally deployed field service personnel.",
        "start_character": 31020,
        "end_character": 31143
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-066937",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-066937-45830a5261e000d5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-066937",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Whether it is for an advancement of current technology, yield and manufacturing improvement, enabling new end device technology, or the development of a new application in our core or emerging markets, we are committed to product excellence and longevity.",
